<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fluor cut to market perform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fluor cut to market perform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer cut Fluor Corp to market perform from a buy rating, according to a source at Oppenheimer.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Fluor stock closed at 64-1/2 Thursday.</p>
</text>
